		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">HMI M2, 10.1 in, 1024 x 600, Ethernet</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Kinco HMI M2 series M2100E, 10.1 inch 1024 x 600 operator panel. Panel cut-out (W x H): 260 x 179 mm, verified, source: https://kincoautomation.ru/en/product/automation/m2/mass-series-2-m2-m2100e-11863. The terminals are the power plug, the COM ports (pin number and signal), Ethernet and the USB ports; the pinout is the one of the MT070 / GL070E manuals and is assumed identical on this model, check it against the datasheet.</elementInformation>
